    <title>Azure/azure-sdk-for-net - Releases - 2026-10-10</title>
    <id>https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net#2026-10-10</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net" />
    <updated>2026-10-11T00:12:35Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.OperationalInsights_1.4.0"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.OperationalInsights_1.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.4.0 (2026-10-08)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgraded the API version to 2026-03-01.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upgraded dependent Azure.Core to 1.62.0.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Corrected the names of Summary Logs enum types. The previous names remain available as obsolete compatibility APIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.TrafficManager_1.2.0"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.TrafficManager_1.2.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.2.0 (2026-10-08)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for the stable Traffic Manager service API version &lt;code&gt;2026-09-01&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added endpoint-specific resource and collection APIs for Azure, External, and Nested Traffic Manager endpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for ahead-of-time (AOT) compilation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deprecated the generic &lt;code&gt;TrafficManagerEndpointResource&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;TrafficManagerEndpointCollection&lt;/code&gt; APIs. Use the endpoint-specific APIs instead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.AppNetwork_1.0.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.AppNetwork_1.0.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.1 (2026-10-09)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial beta release of Azure.Provisioning.AppNetwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.ResourceManager.AppNetwork_1.0.0-beta.2"&gt;Azure.ResourceManager.AppNetwork_1.0.0-beta.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.2 (2026-10-05)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated to support API version &lt;code&gt;2026-08-01-preview&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the &lt;code&gt;Network&lt;/code&gt; property to &lt;code&gt;AppLinkConnectivityProfile&lt;/code&gt; and support for updating connectivity settings with &lt;code&gt;AppLinkConnectivityProfilePatch&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for updating managed identities through &lt;code&gt;AppLinkPatch.Identity&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;AppNetworkManagedServiceIdentityPatch&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Breaking Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changed &lt;code&gt;AppLinkMemberUpdateProperties.ConnectivityProfile&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;AppLinkConnectivityProfile&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;AppLinkConnectivityProfilePatch&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;UpgradeProfile&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;AppLinkUpgradeProfile&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;AppLinkMemberUpgradeProfilePatch&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removed &lt;code&gt;AppLinkMemberUpdateProperties.ObservabilityMetricsEndpoint&lt;/code&gt; and updated the corresponding &lt;code&gt;ArmAppNetworkModelFactory&lt;/code&gt; methods to match the new models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Provisioning.CertificateRegistration_1.0.0-beta.1"&gt;Azure.Provisioning.CertificateRegistration_1.0.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.1 (2026-10-08)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial preview of &lt;code&gt;Azure.Provisioning.CertificateRegistration&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>FluentValidation/FluentValidation - Releases - 2026-10-10</title>
    <id>https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation#2026-10-10</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation" />
    <updated>2026-10-11T00:12:48Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/releases/tag/12.2.0"&gt;12.2.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h1&gt;Release notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.fluentvalidation.net/en/latest/upgrading-to-12.html" rel="nofollow"&gt;Please read the upgrade guide if you are moving from 11.x to 12.x&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes in 12.2.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Lithuanian language (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4096782441" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2350" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2350/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2350"&gt;#2350&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Belarusian language (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4319179573" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2356" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2356/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2356"&gt;#2356&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add GetParentChain() to PropertyChain (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4420798320" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2358" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2358/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2358"&gt;#2358&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix ArgumentNullException in TestValidationResult when a failure has a null PropertyName (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4794356611" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2362" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2362/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2362"&gt;#2362&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reject an inverted range when the comparer returns a negative other than -1 in RangeValidator (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5359269449" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2370" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2370/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2370"&gt;#2370&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change EnumValidator to work under native AOT (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5533254117" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2371" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2371/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2371"&gt;#2371&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix PropertyChain.IsChildChainOf for sibling chains that share a name prefix (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5556634750" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2372" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2372/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2372"&gt;#2372&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix PropertyPath is incorrect in .When() on RuleForEach (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4804992616" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2363" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2363/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2363"&gt;#2363&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes in 12.1.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Tamil language (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3198970089" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2334" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2334/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2334"&gt;#2334&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Telugu language (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3198913972" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2333" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2333/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2333"&gt;#2333&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixes to Japanese translations (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3553239513" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2340" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2340/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2340"&gt;#2340&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes in 12.0.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drops support for netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, .net 5, .net 6 and .net 7. Minimum supported platform is now .net 8.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for dependent rules for custom rules (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1998736587" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2170" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2170/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2170"&gt;#2170&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removes deprecated DI extensions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removes deprecated transform methods (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1453949329" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2027" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2027/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2027"&gt;#2027&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove the ability to disable the root-model null check (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1590679229" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2069" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2069/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2069"&gt;#2069&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Zomp.SyncMethodGenerator to clean up internal sync/async code paths and increase performance (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1841130727" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2136" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2136/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2136"&gt;#2136&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Serbian (Cyrillic) language; rename existing Serbian to Serbian (Latin) (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2724816130" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/issues/2283" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2283/hovercard" href="https://github.com/FluentValidation/FluentValidation/pull/2283"&gt;#2283&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Downloads&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Binaries can be downloaded from nuget:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="http://nuget.org/packages/fluentvalidation" rel="nofollow"&gt;FluentValidation&lt;/a&gt; - Main package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
  </entry>
